# The Rust kernel, checked out **into** this repository by `.github/workflows/release.yaml` so that
# `scripts/check-shapes.ts` can compare against it. `actions/checkout` refuses to write outside the
# workspace, so it lands here. It is tooling input and must never be committed — and `eslint.config.ts`
# ignores it for the same reason (linting another project's files failed a release).
